<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 1.47 bln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 1.47 bln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 1.47 billion dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks	   4	     4			 8.0</p>
<p>    52 weeks	 449.5	 449.5		     8.5</p>
<p>    Two years	 26	    26			 8.8</p>
<p>    Five years     493	   493			 9.5</p>
<p>    10-years	 300	   300			10.0</p>
<p>    15-years	 200	   200			10.25</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	   1,472.5    1,472.5</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for April 21,1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.5 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
